{"part": {"video_part_id": 202, "bvid": "BV1ETw1eXEVt", "page_index": 0, "cid": 27979943703, "title": "【填词翻唱】凤歌", "duration_ms": 343000, "processing_status": "metadata_collected", "created_at": 1791965087, "updated_at": 1791965087}, "transcript": {"transcript_id": 455, "video_part_id": 202, "source_kind": "asr-local", "language": "Chinese", "model_id": 1, "version": 1, "content_sha256": "65c25754ee6491063d06d9295e16f50edc510a8a4c5345e65b92a67cb95b7589", "created_at": 1791984831}, "segments": [{"ordinal": 0, "start_ms": 480, "end_ms": 6880, "text": "我们今天要把这首《凤歌》给它唱了啊，那这里的这个“衰”字念“摧”啊，意思就是"}, {"ordinal": 1, "start_ms": 9200, "end_ms": 11200, "text": "按照一定的等级递减"}, {"ordinal": 2, "start_ms": 12320, "end_ms": 18160, "text": "掉下来啊，就得，其实用何如得之摧啊，"}, {"ordinal": 3, "start_ms": 19360, "end_ms": 26320, "text": "就是你能拿世间道德，就是德行的降低，"}, {"ordinal": 4, "start_ms": 27520, "end_ms": 28800, "text": "拿它怎么办啊？"}, {"ordinal": 5, "start_ms": 28800, "end_ms": 38080, "text": "所以这个念“摧”啊，就是一个等等地的降低啊。"}, {"ordinal": 6, "start_ms": 38320, "end_ms": 51500, "text": "凤兮何德之摧？"}, {"ordinal": 7, "start_ms": 53200, "end_ms": 68880, "text": "凤兮何德之摧？"}, {"ordinal": 8, "start_ms": 84000, "end_ms": 85040, "text": "凤兮何德之摧？"}, {"ordinal": 9, "start_ms": 85040, "end_ms": 92800, "text": "凤兮何德之摧？"}, {"ordinal": 10, "start_ms": 92800, "end_ms": 118240, "text": "来者不待追，来者良德孰可见？"}, {"ordinal": 11, "start_ms": 121360, "end_ms": 131920, "text": "舍生而取义者也，亡者不可见。"}, {"ordinal": 12, "start_ms": 134800, "end_ms": 139600, "text": "天下有道，圣人成焉；，"}, {"ordinal": 13, "start_ms": 141520, "end_ms": 146880, "text": "舍是无道，苟且慎焉。"}, {"ordinal": 14, "start_ms": 150480, "end_ms": 162720, "text": "或知所负轻乎羽，在而不可取。"}, {"ordinal": 15, "start_ms": 166080, "end_ms": 176480, "text": "夫知所以重乎地，莫知之所必。"}, {"ordinal": 16, "start_ms": 179391, "end_ms": 184271, "text": "天下无道，圣人神焉。"}, {"ordinal": 17, "start_ms": 186191, "end_ms": 191231, "text": "方今之时，尽灭性焉。"}, {"ordinal": 18, "start_ms": 193631, "end_ms": 197951, "text": "一而令人易得，"}, {"ordinal": 19, "start_ms": 200511, "end_ms": 207311, "text": "一而令人易得。"}, {"ordinal": 20, "start_ms": 207311, "end_ms": 211711, "text": "待乎画地而去，"}, {"ordinal": 21, "start_ms": 214191, "end_ms": 218671, "text": "待乎画地而去。"}, {"ordinal": 22, "start_ms": 266511, "end_ms": 277151, "text": "弥羊无伤无心，"}, {"ordinal": 23, "start_ms": 279471, "end_ms": 283871, "text": "弥羊无心西去。"}, {"ordinal": 24, "start_ms": 286271, "end_ms": 290991, "text": "弥羊无伤无心，"}, {"ordinal": 25, "start_ms": 293231, "end_ms": 298111, "text": "弥羊无伤无足。"}]}